    <title>shadcn@4.21.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h3&gt;Patch Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12087&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12087/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12087&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/commit/bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn&quot;&gt;@shadcn&lt;/a&gt;! - Add &lt;code&gt;@shadcn/registry&lt;/code&gt;, the registry engine behind the CLI. &lt;code&gt;shadcn&lt;/code&gt; now depends on it, and &lt;code&gt;shadcn/registry&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;shadcn/schema&lt;/code&gt; re-export it, so there are no changes for existing users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12061&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12061/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12061&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/commit/a9c1da49ec4eab488dc99c69ae20a7ffaa4897d4&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;a9c1da49ec4eab488dc99c69ae20a7ffaa4897d4&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn&quot;&gt;@shadcn&lt;/a&gt;! - fix shimmer reduced motion handling when used with a variant&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12087&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/12087/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12087&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/commit/bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Thanks &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn&quot;&gt;@shadcn&lt;/a&gt;! - &lt;code&gt;shadcn docs&lt;/code&gt; only rewrites links on the ui.shadcn.com host.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Updated dependencies [&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/commit/bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bf6646b449684e687f28531305eca4e4768c2782&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt;]:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;@shadcn/registry@0.1.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
